<http://data.silknow.org/event/5ac27deb-9826-3064-b34d-07d265a084c9>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Purchased with 1642-1901 for 15s. Registered File number 31783/1901.\n\nNote on register:\nBrocade of woven silk (kesi) shaped to make the back of a coat. Finely woven in shaded silks of many colours with the addition of gold thread to define the general outlines and to fill in the forms of the dragons, and the Chinese characters. Executed in the finished style of the Qianlong period (1736-95) without the employment of any painted brushwork to eke out the design."@en ;
        ecrm:P22_transferred_title_to  <http://data.silknow.org/actor/f0577f91-f887-3019-bf88-f9e5ba019390> ;
        ecrm:P24_transferred_title_of  <http://data.silknow.org/object/d05844f9-12f1-38bc-95a9-cb6efed9070e> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Purchased with 1642-1901 for 15s. Registered File number 31783/1901.\n\nNote on register:\nBrocade of woven silk (kesi) shaped to make the back of a coat. Finely woven in shaded silks of many colours with the addition of gold thread to define the general outlines and to fill in the forms of the dragons, and the Chinese characters. Executed in the finished style of the Qianlong period (1736-95) without the employment of any painted brushwork to eke out the design."@en .

